<div>
<div>
<h3>Decreto NIS (D.Lgs. 138/2024)</h3>
<ol>
<li id="fonte-1" data-testid="source" data-source="dlgs_138_2024_art_3_c_5_lett_a">
<span>1</span>
<span>
<span>D.Lgs. 138/2024, art. 3 c. 5 lett. a)</span>
<span>Il decreto si applica, indipendentemente dalle dimensioni, ai soggetti identificati come soggetti critici.</span>
